OL,3,GNEWSABaby bank helping more parents in
OL,4,Afull-time work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Birmingham baby bank says it is
OL,7,Fhelping a growing number of people in
OL,8,Ffull-time work who are struggling to
OL,9,Fafford essentials for their children.
OL,11,FKavita Kaur Dhillon and her husband
OL,12,FKarvinder run the Handsworth Baby and
OL,13,FFamily Bank on Soho Road, which
OL,14,Fprovides free items including nappies,
OL,15,Fbaby formula, clothes and toys.
OL,17,FThe couple said the majority of people
OL,18,Fthey first helped were from low-income
OL,19,Fhouseholds, but they were now seeing
OL,20,Fmore working families needing support
OL,21,Fwith everyday costs.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
